    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "A Kantian solution to the fundamental epistemological problem, a monograph by Italian natural philosopher Giordano Bruno Cavagna. Cavagna was born in 1921 in Bologna, Italy. He was Professor of History and Natural Philosophy at Minghetti, an academic institution in Bologna specializing in Classical Studies. His publications include La soluzione kantiana del problema epistemologico fondamentale (1962) and La dottrina della conoscenza in Enrico Bergson (1965). Between the years 1961 and 1966 he was working on his Metafisico classica e cristiana. Giordano Bruno Cavagna died in Bologna on 17 May 1966. This work is the digital edition created by his widow, Anna Romagnoli, dated December 2009. taken from the print edition published in Bologna in May 1962 by S.p.A. Poligrafici Il Resto del Carlino. This edition was sent to the collection by Anna Romagnoli, April 2021",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Giordano Bruno Cavagna.",
